    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I get no kick from champagne",
          "rhyme": "aJ",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Mere alcohol doesn't thrill me at all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So tell me, why shouldn't it be true?",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I get a kick out of brew",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "There's only one beer left",
          "rhyme": "aft",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Rappers screaming all in our ears, like we're deaf",
          "rhyme": "af",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Tempt me, do a number on a label",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Eat up all they emcees and drink 'em under the table",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Like, \"It's on me – put it on my tab, kid\"",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "However you get there – foot it, cab it, iron-horse it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You're leaving on your face, forfeit",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I crush the mic, hold it like the heat, he might toss it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Told him tell 'em they stole it, he told her he lost it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "She told him, \"Get off it,\" and a bunch of other more shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Getting money, DT's be getting no new leads",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "It's like he eating watermelon – stay spitting new seeds",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "It's the weed, give me some of what he drooping off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Soon as he wake up, choking like it was whooping cough",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "They group been soft",
          "rhyme": "Oft",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "First hour at the open bar and they're trooping off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "He went to go laugh and get some head by the side road",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "She asked him autograph her derriere, it read:",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "\"To Wide Load, this yardbird taste like fried toad turd",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Love, Villain\"—take pride in code words",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Crooked eye mode, nerd, geek with a cold heart",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Probably still be speaking in rhymes as an old fart",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Study 'How To Eat To Die' by the pizza guy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "No, he's not too fly to skeet in a skeezer eye",
          "rhyme": "Ej",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "And squeeze her thigh, maybe give her curves a feel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "The same way she feel it when he flow with nerves of steel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "They call the Super when they need their back—uh, plumbing fixed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "\"How is only one left? The pack come in six!",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Whatever happened to two and three?\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "A herb tried to slide with four and five",
          "rhyme": "iv",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "And got caught like, \"What you doing, G?!\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Don't make him have to get cutting like truancy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Matter fact – \"Not for nothing, right now, you and me!\"",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Looser than a pair of Adidas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "I hope you brought your spare tweeters",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "MCs sound like cheerleaders",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Rapping and dancing like Red Head Kingpin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "DOOM came to do the thing again, no matter who be blingin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "He do it for the smelly hubbies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Seeds know what time it is, like it's time for 'Teletubbies'",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Few can do it, even fewer can sell it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Take it from the dude who wear a mask like a 'tarded helmet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "He plots shows like robberies:",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "\"In and out, one, two, three—no bodies, please!",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Run the cash and you won't get a wet sweatshirt\"",
          "rhyme": "9Rt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "The mic is the shotty: nobody move, nobody get hurt",
          "rhyme": "uRt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Bring heat like the boy done gone to war",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "He came in the door and – \"Everybody, on the floor!\"",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "A whole string of jobs like we on tour",
          "rhyme": "uR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "Every night, on the score, coming to your corner store\"",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGFFFHEIJKILHMNOOPQCCRSRTRPUVWXYYPPFZP[\\]ONMN",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABACCACCCBCDDDDABEDAACBBBFCFCFCGABHIICCCBCCHEADED"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"There, it's done",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Now that the representative from South Africa has been mind programmed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "All of the world leaders on earth are under my control",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And when they meet tomorrow in special session",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I, DOOM, shall be voted 'Master of the World'",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "My plan is foolproof, but just in case...\"",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDAE"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"And what about snow?\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "[John Jameson]: Now you keep your eyes open",
          "rhyme": "@n",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "When I tell ya, start snappin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "[Peter Parker]: Oh yeah, sure",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "[UN leader]: Uh, ladies und gentlemen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I am risking my life to tell you with, with great concern",
          "rhyme": "ERn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "That I must warn you, I, I––you must listen!",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Many among you, have, have had their minds taken over {*coughing*}",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "[John Jameson]: What a story, start snappin’",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "[Spider-Man]: DOOM, gosh, I wish I’d brought my autograph book!",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "[DOOM]: Your attempts at humor bore me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "[Spider-Man]: \"Right, lead-head!\"",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "[kid]: \"You’re weird!!!\"",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "[H.E.R.B.I.E.]: Why is everyone staring at us?",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "[Reed Richards, Mr. Fantastic]: Aw, I should have realized, we must look like freaks to them",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "[Ben Grimm, The Thing]: Relax masseur, just do your thing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "[H.E.R.B.I.E.]: Get a good grip on my—",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "[The Thing]: What? Why, I’ll bend your read-out meter for ya, you little",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "[Reed]: Hey, knock it off, Ben",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "[The Thing]: What’s the matter? (Oh, Ben)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "You’re nothing but a chicken-head",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "[H.E.R.B.I.E.]: You overgrown granite-head",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "[Reed]: Hold it!",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFEGCHIJKLMGNOCPJJQ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEEEFCGBEEDEFFHCIEEF"
    }
  ]
